  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Integrity for Public Goods &amp; Services&#x2019; (&#x2018;Integra Initiative&#x2019; in short) seeks to explore innovative pathways for addressing integrity issues that prevent greater efficacy in the delivery and accessibility of two critical public goods, i.e. public health and the sustainable management of natural resources (with a particular focus on mineral resources), collecting evidence on what works and what does not work.</narrative>
  </description>
